# Rustdoc readability

- Open with one summary sentence.
- Give each prose paragraph one idea and no more than three short sentences.
- Use bullets for three or more facts, cases, invariants, or steps.
- Summarize responsibilities and contracts without narrating control flow.
- Put detailed rationale beside the code it explains.
